<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-ANI buys Australian roof bolt maker.</title>
<headline>RTRS-ANI buys Australian roof bolt maker.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian National Industries Ltd (ANI) said on Thursday it had acquired Australian Ground Support (AGS), a Western Australia-based roof bolt maker for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>AGS also distributes products manufactured by ANI Arnall, a unit of ANI.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
